{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50844","headline":"新安郡北百余里即黄山西北有山峯高出颇类大华因目爲小华山前郡守才客题咏至多偶登斯楼因成一绝 · 任宇","name":"新安郡北百余里即黄山西北有山峯高出颇类大华因目爲小华山前郡守才客题咏至多偶登斯楼因成一绝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪晴雨霁潼关道，僊掌分明几度逢。\n可料新安郡楼上，黄山深处见三峯。\n（见康熙十八年闵麟嗣撰《黄山志定本》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任宇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}